<td class=tech_main_wide><p><p><a class=no_und href="https://w3techs.com/technologies">Technologies</a> &gt; <a class=no_und href="https://w3techs.com/technologies/overview/content_management">Content Management</a> &gt; <a class=no_und href="https://w3techs.com/technologies/details/cm-wordpress">WordPress</a> &gt; <a class=no_und href="https://w3techs.com/technologies/details/cm-wordpress/7.1">Version 7.1</a> &gt; Version History<h1>Historical trends in the usage statistics of WordPress version 7.1 for websites</h1><p>This report shows the historical trends in the usage of  subversions of WordPress Version 7.1 since September 2026.<table class=hist><tr><td><td>2026<br>1 Sep<td>2026<br>1 Oct<td>2026<br>1 Nov<td>2026<br>12 Nov<tr><th>version 7.1.3<td><td>&lt;0.1%<td>54.7%<td>44.1%<tr><th>version 7.1.4<td><td><td>6.6%<td>25.1%<tr><th>version 7.1.2<td><td>69.7%<td>31.2%<td>24.9%<tr><th>version 7.1.1<td>100.0%<td>30.3%<td>7.5%<td>5.9%</table><p>The diagram shows only WordPress versions with more than 1% usage.<br><table class=minimal><tr><td><img src="https://w3techs.com/diagram/history_details/cm-wordpress/7.1/m" alt="Historical trends in the usage statistics of WordPress version 7.1" width=900 height=500><td><div class=report_info_cont style="width:120px"><div class=report_info>Find more details in our extensive WordPress market report.<br><br><a href="https://w3techs.com/technologies/report/cm-wordpress"><b>Learn more</b></a></div></div><br clear=all><br><br><br></table><h3>Share this page</h3><ul class="share-buttons"><script>document.write("<"+"li><"+"a href='mailto:?subject="+document.title+"&body="+document.title+" - https://w3techs.com/technologies/history_details/cm-wordpress/7.1' title='Send email'><"+"img loading=lazy alt='Send email' src='https://w3techs.com/pictures/Email.svg'><"+"/a>")</script><li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/sharing/share-offsite/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fw3techs.com%2Ftechnologies%2Fhistory_details%2Fcm-wordpress%2F7.1" title="Share on Lin